häufige migrationsbezogene Kollationsprobleme vermeiden.",[224,225,227],"h2",{"id":226},"zeichensatz-und-kollation","Zeichensatz und Kollation",[220,229,230,231,235,236,239],{},"Stellen Sie sicher, dass ",[232,233,234],"strong",{},"Zeichensatz"," und ",[232,237,238],{},"Kollation"," Ihrer Datenbank, Tabellen und Spalten konsistent sind.",[220,241,242],{},"Kollationsfehler gehören zu den häufigsten Gründen, warum Datenbankmigrationen von FiveNet fehlschlagen, insbesondere nach dem Umzug von Datenbanken zwischen Servern oder dem Import älterer Dumps.",[244,245,246],"callout",{},[220,247,248,249,253,254],{},"Empfohlene Kollation: ",[250,251,252],"code",{},"utf8mb4_unicode_ci","\nEmpfohlener Zeichensatz: ",[250,255,256],{},"utf8mb4",[224,258,260],{"id":259},"aktuelle-datenbankeinstellungen-prüfen","Aktuelle Datenbankeinstellungen prüfen",[220,262,263],{},"Verwenden Sie die folgenden Abfragen, um den aktuellen Zeichensatz und die aktuelle Kollation zu prüfen:",[265,266,271],"pre",{"className":267,"code":268,"language":269,"meta":270,"style":270},"language-sql shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","USE `__IHRE_DATENBANK_NAME_HIER__`;\nSHOW CREATE DATABASE `__IHRE_DATENBANK_NAME_HIER__`;\nSHOW TABLE STATUS;\n","sql","",[250,272,273,297,317],{"__ignoreMap":270},[274,275,278,282,286,290,293],"span",{"class":276,"line":277},"line",1,[274,279,281],{"class":280},"sbssI","USE",[274,283,285],{"class":284},"sMK4o"," `",[274,287,289],{"class":288},"sfazB","__IHRE_DATENBANK_NAME_HIER__",[274,291,292],{"class":284},"`",[274,294,296],{"class":295},"sTEyZ",";\n",[274,298,300,303,306,309,311,313,315],{"class":276,"line":299},2,[274,301,302],{"class":295},"SHOW ",[274,304,305],{"class":280},"CREATE",[274,307,308],{"class":280}," DATABASE",[274,310,285],{"class":284},[274,312,289],{"class":288},[274,314,292],{"class":284},[274,316,296],{"class":295},[274,318,320,322,325,328],{"class":276,"line":319},3,[274,321,302],{"class":295},[274,323,324],{"class":280},"TABLE",[274,326,327],{"class":280}," STATUS",[274,329,296],{"class":295},[220,331,332],{},"Wenn Sie zusätzlich die Kollation einzelner Spalten prüfen möchten, sehen Sie sich die Tabellendefinition direkt an:",[265,334,336],{"className":267,"code":335,"language":269,"meta":270,"style":270},"SHOW CREATE TABLE `__IHRE_TABELLEN_NAME_HIER__`;\n",[250,337,338],{"__ignoreMap":270},[274,339,340,342,344,347,349,352,354],{"class":276,"line":277},[274,341,302],{"class":295},[274,343,305],{"class":280},[274,345,346],{"class":280}," TABLE",[274,348,285],{"class":284},[274,350,351],{"class":288},"__IHRE_TABELLEN_NAME_HIER__",[274,353,292],{"class":284},[274,355,296],{"class":295},[224,357,359],{"id":358},"kollationskonflikte-beheben","Kollationskonflikte beheben",[220,361,362,363,365,366,368,369,376],{},"Eine nützliche Anleitung zum Konvertieren von Tabellen auf ",[250,364,256],{},"\u002F",[250,367,252],{}," in MySQL 5.5 finden Sie auf ",[370,371,375],"a",{"href":372,"rel":373},"https:\u002F\u002Fdba.stackexchange.com\u002Fa\u002F104866",[374],"nofollow","Database Administrators Stack Exchange",".",[220,378,379],{},"Bevor Sie die erzeugten Umwandlungsabfragen ausführen, deaktivieren Sie die Fremdschlüsselprüfung:",[265,381,383],{"className":267,"code":382,"language":269,"meta":270,"style":270},"SET foreign_key_checks = 0;\n",[250,384,385],{"__ignoreMap":270},[274,386,387,390,393,396,399],{"class":276,"line":277},[274,388,389],{"class":280},"SET",[274,391,392],{"class":295}," foreign_key_checks ",[274,394,395],{"class":284},"=",[274,397,398],{"class":280}," 0",[274,400,296],{"class":295},[220,402,403],{},"Nach Abschluss der Umwandlung aktivieren Sie sie wieder:",[265,405,407],{"className":267,"code":406,"language":269,"meta":270,"style":270},"SET foreign_key_checks = 1;\n",[250,408,409],{"__ignoreMap":270},[274,410,411,413,415,417,420],{"class":276,"line":277},[274,412,389],{"class":280},[274,414,392],{"class":295},[274,416,395],{"class":284},[274,418,419],{"class":280}," 1",[274,421,296],{"class":295},[423,424,425],"warning",{},[220,426,427],{},"Das Deaktivieren von Fremdschlüsselprüfungen kann zu Problemen mit der Datenintegrität führen, wenn es nicht sorgfältig gehandhabt wird. Gehen Sie vorsichtig vor.",[224,429,431],{"id":430},"dsn-kollation","DSN-Kollation",[220,433,434],{},"Die Kollation in Ihrer FiveNet-Datenbank-DSN sollte zu der Kollation passen, die Ihr Datenbankserver und Ihre Tabellen verwenden.",[220,436,437],{},"Beispiel:",[265,439,444],{"className":440,"code":442,"language":443,"meta":270},[441],"language-text","DB_USER:DB_PASS@tcp(DB_HOST:DB_PORT)\u002FDB_NAME?collation=utf8mb4_unicode_ci&parseTime=True&loc=Europe%2FBerlin\n","text",[250,445,442],{"__ignoreMap":270},[220,447,448],{},"Wenn Ihre DSN eine andere Kollation als die tatsächliche Datenbank verwendet, können Migrationen oder Abfragen fehlschlagen.",[224,450,452],{"id":451},"erstellen-eines-datenbankbenutzers","Erstellen eines Datenbankbenutzers",[220,454,455,456,459,460,235,463,466],{},"Unten finden Sie Beispielabfragen, um einen Datenbankbenutzer namens ",[250,457,458],{},"fivenet"," mit vollem Zugriff auf eine bestimmte Datenbank zu erstellen. Ersetzen Sie ",[250,461,462],{},"password",[250,464,465],{},"datenbank_name"," vor der Verwendung durch Ihre tatsächlichen Werte.",[265,468,470],{"className":267,"code":469,"language":269,"meta":270,"style":270},"CREATE USER 'fivenet'@'%' IDENTIFIED BY 'password';\nGRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON `datenbank_name`.* TO 'fivenet'@'%';\n",[250,471,472,510],{"__ignoreMap":270},[274,473,474,476,479,482,485,488,491,494,496,499,502,504,506,508],{"class":276,"line":277},[274,475,305],{"class":280},[274,477,478],{"class":280}," USER",[274,480,481],{"class":295}," '",[274,483,458],{"class":484},"s2Zo4",[274,486,487],{"class":295},"'@",[274,489,490],{"class":284},"'",[274,492,493],{"class":288},"%",[274,495,490],{"class":284},[274,497,498],{"class":295}," IDENTIFIED ",[274,500,501],{"class":280},"BY",[274,503,481],{"class":284},[